Package: com.cysxl.immortalizer
Name: Immortalizer
Version: 2.8.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, com.opa334.altlist, com.opa334.ccsupport
Conflicts: com.sergy.immortalizer
Replaces: com.sergy.immortalizer
Provides: com.sergy.immortalizer
Description: A fork of sergy's Immortalizer.
 Keeps chosen apps running in the foreground while they are in the background.
 * immortalize an app from its Home Screen menu.
 * show an indicator & a toast for each app's state.
 * allow notifications from an immortalized app, per app.
 * toggle it from a Control Center module.
